comments.body:
Travel to Thelgen Rock, just North of the Dun Algaz entrance into the Wetlands.&nbsp; The entrance is on the left, surrounded by lvl 20-22 spiders.&nbsp; This little cave is a great place to level, farm sellable/disenchantable items, and improve mining skill.&nbsp; 

Mining skill can be a tad difficult to improve in the 100-150 range (mentioned above I believe) and the incendicite counts towards the mining skill.&nbsp; 
Additionally, one can continue to mine the ore after reaching the six ore necessary to complete the quest.&nbsp; &nbsp; The ore may be auctionable, making it possible to sell the excess ore to those too lazy to travel to the cave themselves.

The spiders are evenly spaced and may be killed one at a time with little chance of being mobbed.&nbsp; The necessity of mining skill (65) prevents some from making use of this cave but the exp. gained from the mobs and the quest make this place great for those who can.
